    "_doc": "ErAV NTR punishment Part 3 - client NPC templates (Docs/Expeditions/Plan_NTR_Punishment_Part3_ClientEvents.md §3.1). Clients are NOT generated by the scenes' TargetGenerations: scenes borrow them from the Kiryu-gumi fallback-worker pool with RequestFallbackWorker [key, ErAV_KiryuGumi_Office, <client MemberType below>, <generator ID here>, count, allowReuse] and park them with ReleaseFallbackWorker, so (allowReuse) the same characters return while they exist; the first request for a MemberType adds that role to the pool. All human clients are generated from jp_generic_adult_base like JP_World/Characters/templates.json's jp_generic_adult_male (Japanese nameGen, Appearance Male); they differ in setHeight/setWeight, title and clothing. The household housekeeper is the only female and has no role (non-interactive, narration only). The dog role uses the RaceDefs/dog generator creature_animal_dog directly. Ages (60s/40s/young) have no generator field - they live in the titles and the scene text. This folder name contains 'nsfw', so safe mode skips the whole directory.",

